{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Choosing an `EnvironmentMissingPolicy`","role":"article"},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@EnvironmentRouter"},{"type":"text","text":" resolves typed navigation, modal, flow, and tab authority"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through the SwiftUI environment. Focused methods cover common actions;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"router.send(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"router.send(flow:)"},{"type":"text","text":" cover explicit intent values. When"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the matching host is missing, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentMissingPolicy"},{"type":"text","text":" decides whether to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"crash, log, or both."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/innorouterswiftui\/guide-environmentmissingpolicy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.swiftui\/documentation\/InnoRouterSwiftUI\/Guide-EnvironmentMissingPolicy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"The-three-policies","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"The three policies"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Policy"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Release"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When to use"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".crash"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"preconditionFailure","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"preconditionFailure","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"parag